msgid "\\nIf you have made the transfer, upload your receipt.\\n"
msgstr "\\n如果您已进行转账,请上传收据。\\n"

msgid "\\nPlease write your e-mail or phone number (at least one).\\n"
msgstr "\\n请写下您的电子邮件或电话号码(至少一个)。\\n"

msgid "Donation summary"
msgstr "捐款概要"

msgid "\\nWrite at least one. We send your receipt and certificate there.\\n"
msgstr "\\n至少写一个。我们会将您的收据和证书发送到那里。\\n"

msgid "\\nContinue to payment\\n"
msgstr "\\n继续付款\\n"

msgid "\\nI have read and accept the%1$sprivacy policy%2$sand the%3$sdonation agreement%4$s.\\n"
msgstr "\\n我已阅读并接受%1$s隐私政策%2$s和%3$s捐赠协议%4$s。\\n"

msgid "\\nMake payment\\n"
msgstr "\\n付款\\n"

msgid "\\nPlease read and accept the terms to continue.\\n"
msgstr "\\n请阅读并接受条款以继续。\\n"

msgid "\\nDonation terms\\n"
msgstr "\\n捐赠条款\\n"

msgid "\\nPrivacy policy\\n"
msgstr "\\n隐私政策\\n"

msgid "\\nThese terms apply to donations made on this site to%s.\\n"
msgstr "\\n这些条款适用于在本网站上向%s进行的捐赠。\\n"

msgid "\\nA donation is a gift without anything in return. It is used for the purpose chosen on the donation form (for example sapling planting). When a purpose is fully funded, the association may use the donation for a similar purpose.\\n"
msgstr "\\n捐赠是一种礼物,没有任何回报。它用于捐赠表格上选择的目的(例如树苗种植)。当某个目的得到全额资助时,协会可以将捐款用于类似目的。\\n"

msgid "\\nCard payments are processed by the licensed payment institution iyzico with 3D Secure. Card details are not stored on this site. For bank transfers, the donation is confirmed when the money reaches the association account.\\n"
msgstr "\\n卡支付由持牌支付机构 iyzico 和 3D Secure 处理。该网站不存储银行卡详细信息。对于银行转账,当资金到达协会帐户时,捐款即被确认。\\n"

msgid "\\nA monthly donation is charged to the same card every month until you cancel it. You can cancel it at any time from your account page or by writing to us.\\n"
msgstr "\\n每月捐款会每月从同一张卡中扣除,直到您取消为止。您可以随时从您的帐户页面或写信给我们取消它。\\n"

msgid "\\nThe online certificate is sent to the e-mail address or phone number you give after the payment is confirmed. Please check the names you write on the certificate.\\n"
msgstr "\\n付款确认后,在线证书将发送至您提供的电子邮件地址或电话号码。请检查您写在证书上的姓名。\\n"

msgid "\\nCancellation and refunds\\n"
msgstr "\\n取消和退款\\n"

msgid "\\nIf a donation was made by mistake (wrong amount or a double payment), write to us within 14 days and it is refunded to the same card or account.\\n"
msgstr "\\nIf a donation was made by mistake (wrong amount or a double payment), write to us within 14 days and it is refunded to the same card or account.\\n"

msgid "Personal data"
msgstr "个人资料"

msgid "\\nYour name and contact details are used to record the donation, send the receipt and certificate, and contact you about your donation. See the privacy policy for details.\\n"
msgstr "\\n您的姓名和联系方式将用于记录捐赠、发送收据和证书,并就捐赠事宜与您联系。有关详细信息,请参阅隐私政策。\\n"

msgid "\\nFor any question about your donation, write to us on WhatsApp:%s\\n"
msgstr "\\n如果对您的捐赠有任何疑问,请通过 WhatsApp 给我们写信:%s\\n"

msgid "\\nFor any question about your donation, write to us through the contact page.\\n"
msgstr "\\n如果对您的捐赠有任何疑问,请通过联系页面写信给我们。\\n"

msgid "\\n%sprocesses your personal data under the Turkish Personal Data Protection Law (KVKK).\\n"
msgstr "\\n%s根据土耳其个人数据保护法 (KVKK) 处理您的个人数据。\\n"

msgid "\\nWhat we collect\\n"
msgstr "\\n我们收集什么\\n"

msgid "\\nName, e-mail address, phone number and the details of your donation. Card details are entered on the payment institution and are not stored by us.\\n"
msgstr "\\n姓名、电子邮件地址、电话号码和您的捐款详细信息。卡详细信息由支付机构输入,我们不会存储。\\n"

msgid "Why"
msgstr "为什么"

msgid "\\nTo record donations, send receipts and certificates, meet legal obligations and answer your questions.\\n"
msgstr "\\n记录捐款、发送收据和证书、履行法律义务并回答您的问题。\\n"

msgid "\\nYour rights\\n"
msgstr "\\n您的权利\\n"

msgid "\\nYou can ask what data we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted, by writing to us.\\n"
msgstr "\\n您可以写信给我们,询问我们持有您的哪些数据、更正或删除这些数据。\\n"

